<p class="names"><strong>Integrantes:</strong> Otávio, Samuel, Maria, Marina, Gabriel Victor, Augusto e Davi Casteliano<br><strong>Turma:</strong> <span contenteditable="true" aria-label="Editar turma">Clique para preencher</span> &nbsp; · &nbsp; <strong>Data:</strong> <span contenteditable="true" aria-label="Editar data">Clique para preencher</span></p>
